<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The amortized cost and fair value of securities
available-for-sale at June 30, 2026, by contractual maturity, are shown below. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_HeldToMaturitySecuritiesTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:HeldToMaturitySecuritiesTextBlock" id="ixv-20467">Expected maturities will differ from contractual maturities
because issuers may have the right to call or prepay obligations with or without call or prepayment penalties.</ix:nonNumeric></p>

