</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_LoansNotesTradeAndOtherReceivablesDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_8" id="_LoansNotesTradeAndOtherReceivablesDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_7"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company evaluates the loan risk grading system
definitions and allowance for credit loss methodology on an ongoing basis. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_FinancingReceivableCreditQualityIndicatorsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableCreditQualityIndicatorsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-20766">The following table presents loan balances by credit quality
indicators and gross chargeoffs by loan category and year of origination as of June 30, 2026.</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

