<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisTableTextBlock" id="ixv-16956"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following tables present quantitative information
about unobservable inputs used in recurring and nonrecurring Level 3 fair value measurements.</p>

