    </div><!-- Field: /Page --><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">State Bank&#8217;s actual capital levels and ratios
as of June 30, 2026, and December 31, 2025, are presented in the following table. Capital levels are presented for State Bank only as
the Company is exempt from quarterly reporting on capital levels at the holding company level:</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

